    "description": "Premium Prestige 3D crystal - elegant memorial gift for distinguished veterans and VIP tributes. Three sizes available. Museum-quality engraving.",
    "longDescription": "Present the ultimate tribute with our Prestige Crystal, a distinguished memorial piece designed for honoring high-ranking veterans, significant life achievements, and VIP commemorations. This premium crystal represents our finest craftsmanship, combining elegant design with museum-quality 3D laser engraving that befits prestigious occasions and important memorial tributes.\n\nThe Prestige Crystal features a sophisticated architectural design that commands respect and attention. Available in three substantial sizes, this crystal is perfect for executive gifts, military retirement ceremonies, memorial services for distinguished individuals, and occasions where only the finest tribute will do.\n\n**Prestigious Memorial Occasions:**\n- High-ranking military veteran tributes\n- Executive retirement gifts\n- Distinguished service awards\n- Memorial services for VIPs\n- Presidential and congressional gifts\n- Significant lifetime achievement recognition\n- Museum and institution memorials\n\n**Prestige Features:**\n- Elegant architectural design\n- Three substantial sizes (13x9cm, 16x13cm, 19x15cm)\n- Museum-quality 3D laser engraving\n- Premium crystal clarity and weight\n- Sophisticated presentation\n- Multiple luxury light base options\n- Suitable for formal displays\n\nThe larger size options make this crystal ideal for prominent display in corporate offices, memorial halls, military installations, or home libraries where significant tributes deserve prominent placement. The weight and clarity of the crystal immediately communicate quality and importance.\n\n**Ideal For:**\n- General and Admiral retirements\n- Congressional Medal of Honor recipients\n- Presidential tributes\n- CEO and executive memorials\n- University and institution honors\n- Significant anniversary celebrations\n- High-profile memorial services\n\n**Customization for Prestige:**\n- Formal portraits and official photos\n- Military rank, awards, and insignia\n- Service records and achievements\n- Formal epitaphs and citations\n- 2D or 3D backdrop enhancement\n- Premium custom text placement\n- Background removal service\n\nThis Prestige Crystal is frequently chosen for military change-of-command ceremonies, retirement celebrations for senior officers, and memorial services where the individual's significance merits exceptional recognition. The crystal's substantial presence and elegant design communicate respect, honor, and lasting appreciation.\n\n**Investment in Honor:**\nStarting at $235, the Prestige Crystal represents a significant investment appropriate for significant individuals and occasions. This is not a casual gift—it's a statement of profound respect and lasting tribute that reflects the importance of the person being honored.",
