    "id": "148",
    "name": "Rectangle Horizontal Crystals",
    "slug": "rectangle-horizontal-crystals",
    "sku": "Rectangle_Horizontal_Crystals",
    "basePrice": 85,
    "description": "Horizontal rectangle 3D photo crystal in 8 sizes. Landscape orientation ideal for family photos, military groups, and veteran tributes. Premium memorial gift.",
    "longDescription": "Capture life's most important moments in landscape orientation with our Rectangle Horizontal Crystal, designed specifically for family groups, military units, and wide-format photographs. Available in 8 sizes from small (6x4cm) to presidential (27x18cm), this horizontal crystal orientation is perfect for commemorating group photos, military formations, family gatherings, and scenic memorial tributes.\n\nThe landscape format makes this crystal ideal for photographs that tell broader stories—military units standing together, families gathered for holidays, veterans with their brothers-in-arms, or scenic locations that held special meaning. Our 3D laser engraving captures every person, every detail, creating memorial pieces that honor not just individuals but the relationships and bonds that defined their lives.\n\n**Ideal for Landscape Photos:**\n- Military unit and platoon photos\n- Family gathering and reunion photos\n- Veteran brothers-in-arms tributes\n- Scenic memorial locations\n- Horizontal portrait compositions\n- Christmas family traditions\n- Wide-format memorial displays\n\n**Size Options** (all at $85 base):\n- Small: 6x4cm - Desk size\n- Medium: 8x5cm - Popular choice\n- Large: 9x6cm - Enhanced detail\n- XLarge: 12x8cm - Statement size\n- Mini Mantel: 15x10cm - Mantel perfect\n- Mantel: 18x12cm - Family showcase\n- Mini Presidential: 22x16cm - Executive display\n- Presidential: 27x18cm - Premium memorial\n\n**Rectangle Horizontal Features:**\n- Landscape orientation for wide photos\n- 3D laser engraving with depth\n- 8 size options for any budget\n- Perfect for group photographs\n- Military formation appropriate\n- Multiple light base options\n- Professional display quality\n\n**Perfect For:**\n- Veteran unit reunion tributes\n- Family Christmas traditions\n- Military change-of-command gifts\n- Retirement ceremony displays\n- Memorial service group photos\n- Anniversary celebration gifts\n- Christmas family keepsakes\n\nThe horizontal format is particularly effective for military formations, showing entire units or squads together—honoring not just individual service but the bonds of brotherhood forged in service. Many veteran organizations use these crystals for reunion gifts, retirement presents, and memorial tributes to fallen comrades.\n\n**Customization Options:**\n- Unit designation and service dates\n- Military insignia and branch\n- \"Never Forget\" memorial text\n- Family names and occasions\n- 2D or 3D backdrop enhancement\n- Background removal service\n- Custom memorial inscriptions\n\nThis crystal is also perfect for Christmas family traditions—many families create annual crystals featuring their holiday gatherings, building collections that document family growth and celebrate togetherness across generations.\n\n**Display Versatility:**\nThe horizontal orientation suits modern design aesthetics and fits beautifully on mantel displays, horizontal shelving, and contemporary memorial arrangements. The wide format draws the eye across the composition, inviting viewers to study details and remember stories.",
