    "id": "156",
    "name": "Heart Keychain",
    "slug": "heart-keychain",
    "sku": "Heart_Keychain",
    "basePrice": 55,
    "description": "Heart-shaped 3D crystal photo keychain - carry memorial photos of veterans and loved ones everywhere. Personalized engraving, perfect remembrance gift.",
    "longDescription": "Keep your loved ones close to your heart—literally—with our Heart-Shaped 3D Crystal Photo Keychain. This miniature memorial masterpiece allows you to carry cherished memories of veterans, family members, or special moments wherever you go. Perfect as a remembrance gift, veteran tribute, or meaningful Christmas stocking stuffer.\n\nDespite its compact size, this heart crystal keychain features the same professional-quality 3D laser engraving found in our larger pieces. Your photograph is captured with stunning clarity and depth, creating a portable memorial or keepsake that travels with you through every day.\n\n**Meaningful Memorial Keychain:**\n- Veteran and military photo keepsakes\n- Memorial gifts for remembering loved ones\n- Pet memorial keepsakes\n- Anniversary and relationship gifts\n- Stocking stuffer with meaning\n- Daily reminder of loved ones\n\n**Features:**\n- Heart-shaped design symbolizes love and remembrance\n- Durable crystal construction (won't scratch or fade)\n- 3D laser engraving for depth and clarity\n- Optional custom text (names, dates, messages)\n- 2D or 3D backdrop options\n- Sturdy keychain attachment included\n- Compact and portable\n\nThis heart crystal keychain makes an incredibly thoughtful gift for those grieving, celebrating a memory, or simply wanting to keep someone special close. Many of our customers purchase these as memorial gifts for funeral services, veteran commemorations, or as Christmas gifts that carry deep personal meaning.\n\nThe heart shape is universally recognized as a symbol of love, making this the perfect way to show someone you care while honoring a cherished memory. Whether attached to car keys, a purse, or displayed on a small stand, this crystal keychain serves as a constant reminder of love that transcends time and distance.",
