    "id": "166",
    "name": "Ornament Crystal",
    "slug": "ornament-crystal",
    "sku": "Ornament_Crystal",
    "basePrice": 99,
    "description": "3D crystal Christmas ornament with personalized photo engraving. Perfect memorial gift for veterans and loved ones. Beautiful holiday keepsake that lasts forever.",
    "longDescription": "Transform your Christmas tree into a gallery of cherished memories with our exquisite 3D Crystal Christmas Ornament. This personalized photo ornament is more than decoration—it's a heartfelt memorial gift that honors veterans, celebrates family, and preserves your most treasured moments in stunning laser-engraved crystal.\n\nEach ornament is carefully crafted using state-of-the-art 3D laser engraving technology, capturing your photograph with remarkable depth and clarity. Whether you're commemorating a loved one who served, celebrating baby's first Christmas, or creating a memorial tribute, this crystal ornament becomes a meaningful tradition that grows more precious with each passing year.\n\n**Perfect Christmas & Memorial Gift:**\n- Veteran and military memorial ornaments\n- Family photo Christmas decorations\n- Memorial tribute for loved ones passed\n- Baby's first Christmas keepsake\n- Pet memorial ornaments\n- Wedding and anniversary commemorations\n\n**Why Choose Our Crystal Ornaments:**\n- Unbreakable memories: Unlike glass, crystal is durable and long-lasting\n- Professional 3D engraving captures incredible detail\n- Optional custom text for personalization\n- 2D or 3D backdrop options available\n- Comes ready to hang with premium ribbon\n- Makes a thoughtful sympathy or memorial gift\n\nOur crystal ornaments are designed to be displayed year-round, not just during holidays. Many families create memorial displays featuring loved ones or military service members, making these ornaments a centerpiece of remembrance and celebration.\n\n**Customization Options:**\n- Add names, dates, or special messages\n- Background removal for clean, professional look\n- 2D or 3D backdrop enhancement\n- Custom text engraving\n\nGive the gift of lasting memories this Christmas. Each crystal ornament is individually crafted with care and arrives beautifully presented, ready to become a treasured family heirloom.",
