    "description": "Large dog bone shaped 3D crystal memorial for beloved pets and military K9 units. Premium tribute for loyal companions. Available in two orientations.",
    "longDescription": "Create the ultimate tribute to canine companions with our Large Dog Bone Crystal, a substantial memorial piece designed specifically for honoring beloved dogs and military K9 veterans. Available in vertical and horizontal orientations, this premium dog bone-shaped crystal represents our most significant pet memorial offering—perfect for those seeking to honor the unconditional love, loyalty, and service that dogs provide throughout their lives.\n\nThis is not a small ornament—it's a substantial memorial display piece that commands attention and respect, appropriate for the incredible impact dogs have on our lives. Whether commemorating a family pet who was a beloved member of your household or honoring a military working dog who served alongside our troops, this crystal dog bone provides the dignity and recognition these faithful companions deserve.\n\n**Premium Pet Memorial:**\n- Large-scale dog memorial displays\n- Military K9 and working dog tributes\n- Police and service dog memorials\n- Therapy and emotional support dog honors\n- Significant pet loss tributes\n- Veterinary clinic memorial walls\n- Dog rescue and shelter tributes\n\n**Dog Bone Crystal Features:**\n- Substantial size (premium display piece)\n- Classic bone shape universally recognized\n- 3D laser engraving captures personality\n- Available vertical or horizontal orientation\n- Premium crystal clarity and weight\n- Optional wooden or LED light bases\n- Military K9 appropriate for tributes\n\n**Vertical Dog Bone (ID: 286):**\nPerfect for portrait-style dog photos, formal military K9 portraits, or sitting/standing poses. The vertical orientation creates an elegant upright display ideal for mantels, memorial shelves, or K9 veteran tribute walls.\n\n**Horizontal Dog Bone (ID: 288):**\nIdeal for action shots, running poses, or landscape-style compositions featuring dogs in their element. The horizontal orientation suits modern display aesthetics and creates visual interest in memorial arrangements.\n\n**Military K9 Tributes:**\nThese dog bone crystals are specifically appropriate for honoring military working dogs, police K9s, and service dogs who have made sacrifices in the line of duty. Many military families, law enforcement agencies, and veterans organizations choose these crystals for formal K9 memorial ceremonies and tribute displays.\n\n**Customization Options:**\n- Dog's name, breed, and dates\n- Military rank or K9 unit designation\n- Service awards and commendations\n- Paw print designs\n- \"Until We Meet at the Rainbow Bridge\" messages\n- Military branch insignias for K9 units\n- 2D or 3D backdrop enhancement\n\nDogs give us their entire lives—their puppyhood energy, their mature loyalty, their elderly devotion. This substantial crystal memorial ensures that their memory receives the honor and permanence they deserve. Unlike photographs that can fade or deteriorate, these crystals preserve your dog's image in pristine clarity for generations.\n\n**Display Recommendations:**\n- Mantel centerpiece with light base\n- Memorial shelf dedicated to pets\n- K9 veteran tribute walls\n- Veterinary clinic memorial displays\n- Dog rescue tribute galleries\n- Home memorial sanctuaries\n\n**Perfect Gift For:**\n- Families grieving pet loss\n- Military K9 handlers\n- Police K9 officers\n- Dog rescue organizations\n- Veterinary professionals\n- Service dog trainers\n- Dog breeders and enthusiasts\n\nAt $300, these dog bone crystals represent a significant investment appropriate for the significant role dogs play in our lives—whether as family members who brought daily joy or as working dogs who served and sacrificed alongside military and law enforcement personnel.",
