    "id": "290",
    "name": "3D Crystal Desk Lamp",
    "slug": "3d-crystal-desk-lamp",
    "sku": "3d_desk_lamp_bundle",
    "basePrice": 385,
    "description": "3D crystal desk lamp with illuminated photo. Functional memorial gift for veterans. Beautiful tribute that lights up memories daily.",
    "longDescription": "Transform any workspace into a memorial sanctuary with our 3D Crystal Desk Lamp, a functional tribute that combines beautiful illumination with meaningful remembrance. This isn't just a lamp—it's a daily reminder of loved ones, veterans, and cherished memories that literally brightens your life while lighting your desk, nightstand, or memorial space.\n\nThe built-in LED base illuminates your 3D engraved crystal from within, creating a stunning visual effect that brings photographs to life with light and dimension. Whether honoring a veteran, remembering a loved one, or celebrating someone special, this desk lamp ensures their memory shines bright in your daily life.\n\n**Functional Memorial Gift:**\n- Veteran desk memorial lamps\n- Remembrance gifts that serve a purpose\n- Office memorial displays\n- Bedside memorial lighting\n- Retirement gifts with meaning\n- Military tribute displays\n- Christmas gifts for desk or nightstand\n\n**Crystal Desk Lamp Features:**\n- Integrated LED lighting base included\n- 3D laser engraved crystal with depth\n- Functional lighting for desk or bedside\n- Multiple light modes and brightness settings\n- Energy-efficient LED technology\n- Beautiful day or night display\n- Premium quality construction\n\nThis desk lamp is particularly appreciated by those who want memorial pieces that integrate into daily life rather than sitting static on a shelf. The lamp serves a practical purpose while constantly reminding you of those you love and miss. Many customers place these on office desks, creating meaningful workspace environments, or on nightstands, making loved ones the last thing they see before sleep.\n\n**Perfect Gift For:**\n- Veterans and active military members\n- Those grieving significant loss\n- Retirement celebrations\n- Memorial service gifts\n- Widows and widowers\n- Office memorial tributes\n- Christmas gifts with meaning\n\n**Customization Options:**\n- 3D photo engraving with depth perception\n- Custom text for names, dates, messages\n- 2D or 3D backdrop enhancement\n- Background removal service\n- Multiple photo angles possible\n\nThe 3D engraving technology creates remarkable depth within the crystal, making photographs appear almost holographic when illuminated. Military uniforms, medals, and insignias are captured with precision, making this lamp ideal for veteran tributes and military families.\n\n**Emotional Impact:**\nCustomers consistently report that these desk lamps become their most treasured possessions. The combination of beauty, function, and meaning creates emotional connections that photographs or traditional memorials can't match. Turning on the lamp each day becomes a ritual of remembrance, connection, and celebration.\n\nThis crystal desk lamp works equally well for honoring living family members—many customers feature deployed service members, deployed children, or distant grandchildren, keeping them \"present\" even when they're far away.\n\n**Investment Piece:**\nAt $385, this is a premium memorial gift that reflects the significance of the person being honored. The quality construction, integrated lighting, and emotional impact make this an heirloom-quality piece that will be treasured for decades.",
