    "id": "440",
    "name": "2D Crystal Heart Ornament",
    "slug": "2d-crystal-heart-ornament",
    "sku": "Heart_Ornament_bundle",
    "basePrice": 45,
    "description": "2D heart crystal Christmas ornament with personalized photo. Elegant memorial gift for veterans and loved ones. Affordable keepsake ornament.",
    "longDescription": "Celebrate love and honor memories with our 2D Crystal Heart Ornament, an affordable yet elegant way to transform your Christmas tree into a memorial of cherished moments. This heart-shaped crystal ornament is perfect for honoring veterans, remembering loved ones, or celebrating life's precious milestones during the holiday season and beyond.\n\nOur 2D laser engraving process creates beautifully detailed images on high-quality crystal, offering exceptional clarity at an accessible price point. The heart shape makes this ornament ideal for expressing love, remembrance, and gratitude—whether you're commemorating military service, celebrating family, or creating a memorial tribute.\n\n**Perfect Ornament For:**\n- Veteran Christmas memorial ornaments\n- \"In Loving Memory\" holiday tributes\n- First Christmas as a family\n- Memorial gifts for loss and sympathy\n- Pet memorial ornaments\n- Grandparent photo gifts\n- Military family Christmas traditions\n\n**Why Choose 2D Heart Ornament:**\n- Budget-friendly memorial gift option\n- Classic 2D engraving with sharp, clear detail\n- Heart design conveys love and remembrance\n- Durable crystal construction\n- Ready to hang with premium attachment\n- Personalization available with custom text\n- Makes meaningful stocking stuffer\n\nThis 2D heart ornament is part of our ornament collection designed specifically for those seeking affordable memorial gifts without compromising quality. While our 3D ornaments offer depth perception, this 2D version provides crisp, photograph-quality engraving that beautifully captures faces, insignias, and special moments.\n\n**Customization Options:**\n- Custom text engraving (names, dates, service branch)\n- 2D or 3D backdrop enhancement\n- Background removal for clean presentation\n- Optional special messages\n\nMany families create ornament collections featuring different loved ones or military service members, making each Christmas tree a celebration of family history and military heritage. This ornament also makes a thoughtful sympathy gift or memorial present for those experiencing loss.",
