    "description": "Flower-shaped 2D crystal ornament with custom photo engraving. Unique memorial gift for Christmas and remembrance. Elegant floral keepsake design.",
    "longDescription": "Honor loved ones with the beauty of nature through our 2D Crystal Flower Ornament, a unique memorial keepsake that combines elegant floral design with personalized photo engraving. This distinctive flower-shaped crystal ornament is perfect for memorial tributes, veteran commemorations, and Christmas celebrations that honor life's most precious memories.\n\nThe flower symbolizes life, growth, and eternal beauty—making this ornament especially meaningful for memorial gifts, sympathy presents, and tributes to those who have passed. Our precision 2D laser engraving captures your photograph with exceptional clarity, creating a touching remembrance piece that blooms with memories year after year.\n\n**Ideal Memorial & Gift Occasions:**\n- Memorial Christmas ornaments for loved ones\n- Veteran and military tribute ornaments\n- Sympathy and bereavement gifts\n- Garden and nature lovers\n- Mother's Day memorial gifts\n- Celebration of life ceremonies\n- Spring and holiday decorations\n\n**Flower Ornament Features:**\n- Unique flower-shaped design stands out on any tree\n- High-quality 2D crystal engraving\n- Affordable memorial gift option\n- Durable, long-lasting crystal construction\n- Personalization with custom text available\n- 2D or 3D backdrop options\n- Comes with hanging attachment\n\nThe flower design offers a softer, more nature-inspired alternative to traditional ornaments, making it particularly appropriate for those who loved gardening, nature, or simply appreciated life's natural beauty. Many customers choose this ornament to honor mothers, grandmothers, or beloved family members who brought beauty into their lives.\n\n**Customization Available:**\n- Add names, dates, or memorial messages\n- Background removal service\n- 2D or 3D backdrop enhancement\n- Special inscriptions and quotes\n\nThis flower ornament also makes an excellent addition to memorial displays, celebration of life services, or as part of a memory tree dedicated to honoring those who have passed. Its unique shape and meaningful symbolism create conversations and provide comfort to those remembering loved ones.",
