    "basePrice": 259,
    "description": "3D crystal dome with curved engraving technology. Unique memorial gift for veterans. Two sizes available. Innovative hemisphere design creates stunning depth.",
    "longDescription": "Experience the future of memorial art with our 3D Crystal Dome, an innovative hemisphere design that pushes the boundaries of laser engraving technology. This curved crystal creates unique optical effects impossible with flat surfaces—photographs appear to wrap around the dome's interior, creating immersive viewing experiences that change as you move around the crystal.\n\nThe dome shape represents protection, encompassment, and eternal shelter—meaningful symbolism for memorial tributes. The curved engraving surface creates remarkable depth perception, making photographs appear almost holographic and three-dimensional within the crystal sphere. This is memorial art that commands attention and creates conversations.\n\n**Innovative Dome Design:**\n- Curved 3D laser engraving technology\n- Hemisphere creates unique optical effects\n- Two size options (small and medium)\n- 360-degree partial viewing\n- Captures multiple angles in single piece\n- Futuristic memorial aesthetic\n- Museum-quality presentation\n\n**Crystal Dome Applications:**\n- Veteran memorial innovations\n- Modern memorial service tributes\n- Executive retirement gifts\n- Contemporary memorial displays\n- Museum and gallery pieces\n- Architectural memorial installations\n- Premium Christmas gifts\n\n**3D Dome Features:**\n- Advanced curved surface engraving\n- Two size options for different spaces\n- Remarkable depth perception\n- Multiple light base compatibility\n- Optional rotating base for dynamic display\n- 2D or 3D backdrop enhancement\n- Premium crystal clarity\n\n**Optical Properties:**\nThe curved surface of the dome creates optical effects that flat crystals cannot achieve. As light enters the dome, it refracts differently through the curved crystal, creating internal reflections and depth perceptions that make photographs appear almost alive within the sphere. When paired with rotating LED bases, the effect becomes truly mesmerizing.\n\n**Symbolism:**\nThe dome represents:\n- Protection and shelter (like a protective dome over memories)\n- Completeness and fullness of life\n- Innovative spirit and forward thinking\n- Modern memorial traditions\n- Technological advancement in remembrance\n\nThis makes the crystal dome particularly appropriate for honoring innovators, technology enthusiasts, forward-thinking veterans, and those who embraced modern approaches to life.\n\n**Perfect For:**\n- Tech-savvy veterans and service members\n- Modern military branches (Space Force, Cyber Command)\n- Innovation and science professionals\n- Contemporary memorial services\n- Museum and gallery memorial displays\n- Executive and VIP tributes\n\n**Size Options:**\n- Small Dome: Intimate desk or shelf display\n- Medium Dome: Substantial centerpiece presence\n\n**Customization:**\n- 3D photo engraving on curved surface\n- Custom text and memorial inscriptions\n- Military insignia and modern unit patches\n- 2D or 3D backdrop options\n- Background removal service\n\n**Display Recommendations:**\nThe crystal dome is particularly stunning when paired with:\n- Rotating LED light base (creates dynamic display)\n- Premium wooden bases (combines modern and traditional)\n- Spotlighting in memorial displays\n- Glass cases for museum-quality presentation",
