    "id": "454",
    "name": "3D Crystal Large Cat ",
    "slug": "3d-crystal-large-cat",
    "sku": "3d_crystal_large_cat",
    "basePrice": 209,
    "description": "Large 3D crystal cat sculpture with engraved photo. Premium pet memorial for beloved felines. Museum-quality tribute for cherished cat companions.",
    "longDescription": "Honor your beloved feline companion with the ultimate tribute—our Large 3D Crystal Cat, a substantial memorial sculpture designed specifically for celebrating the cats who enriched our lives with their independent spirits, affectionate moments, and unique personalities. This is not a small ornament—it's a prominent display piece that recognizes cats as the significant family members they truly are.\n\nThis premium cat memorial features three-dimensional sculpting that captures feline form and grace, combined with internal laser engraving of your actual cat's photograph. The result is a stunning fusion of artistic sculpture and personal memorial that honors your specific cat while celebrating the universal beauty of felines.\n\n**Premium Cat Memorial:**\n- Large sculptural crystal form\n- Cat-shaped 3D design\n- Internal photo engraving of your cat\n- Museum-quality presentation\n- Substantial display piece\n- Multiple light base options\n- Professional cat tribute\n\n**Perfect Cat Memorial Gift:**\n- Rainbow Bridge sympathy gifts\n- Cat loss and bereavement\n- Veterinary clinic memorial walls\n- Cat rescue tribute displays\n- Cat lover Christmas gifts\n- Pet memorial services\n- Significant cat tribute displays\n\n**Large Cat Crystal Features:**\n- Substantial size commands presence\n- Cat-shaped crystal sculpture\n- 3D laser photo engraving inside\n- Captures cat's personality and features\n- Premium crystal clarity\n- Multiple light base compatibility\n- Personalization with cat's name\n\n**Why Cats Deserve Premium Memorials:**\nCats choose to love us—their affection is earned, not guaranteed. This makes their companionship particularly special and worthy of significant memorial tributes. While dogs are celebrated openly, cats often receive less recognition despite the profound bonds they create with their humans.\n\nThis large crystal cat memorial corrects that imbalance, providing cat lovers with a memorial piece that reflects the true significance of feline companions. At $209, this is a substantial investment that acknowledges cats as legitimate family members deserving of proper tribute.\n\n**Cat Memorial Applications:**\n- Home memorial displays for deceased cats\n- Celebration of living cat companions\n- Multiple cat household tributes\n- Veterinary clinic memorial walls\n- Cat rescue organization displays\n- Pet loss support groups\n- Cat breeder tributes\n\n**Customization Options:**\n- Your cat's actual photo engraved inside\n- Cat's name, breed, and dates\n- \"Forever in My Heart\" inscriptions\n- Paw print designs\n- 2D or 3D backdrop enhancement\n- Rainbow Bridge memorial verses\n- Custom memorial text\n\n**Emotional Impact:**\nUnlike generic cat statues or figurines, this memorial features YOUR cat—their unique markings, their specific expression, their individual personality captured in crystal. This personal connection creates emotional resonance that generic memorial items cannot match.\n\n**Display Recommendations:**\nThe large size makes this cat memorial suitable for:\n- Mantel centerpieces\n- Memorial shelf focal points\n- Home sanctuary displays\n- Pet memory tables\n- Living room showcases\n- Bedroom dresser tributes\n\nPair with premium light bases to illuminate your cat's image from within, creating a glowing tribute that catches attention and invites stories about your feline friend.\n\n**Perfect Gift For:**\n- Cat owners grieving loss\n- Cat lovers at Christmas\n- Veterinarians and vet techs\n- Cat rescue volunteers\n- Cat breeders\n- \"Crazy cat ladies\" (a badge of honor!)\n- Anyone whose cat was family",
