    "description": "3D crystal cube with laser engraved photo. Versatile memorial gift for veterans and loved ones. Modern geometric design, multiple viewing angles.",
    "longDescription": "Experience memorial art from all sides with our 3D Crystal Square (cube), a geometric marvel that offers multiple viewing perspectives in a single piece. This crystal cube design represents modern memorial aesthetics, combining clean architectural lines with sophisticated 3D laser engraving that can be viewed from any angle.\n\nThe square/cube format is particularly meaningful for military memorials—its geometric precision and balanced proportions reflect military discipline, order, and the structured service life of veterans. The ability to view the crystal from all sides symbolizes the multi-faceted nature of service members' lives—their military roles, family relationships, and personal identities all captured in one memorial piece.\n\n**Modern Memorial Design:**\n- Geometric crystal cube/square shape\n- 3D laser engraving visible from multiple angles\n- Contemporary architectural aesthetic\n- Clean lines and balanced proportions\n- Versatile display orientation\n- Suits modern and traditional decor\n- Professional presentation quality\n\n**Crystal Square Applications:**\n- Veteran and military memorials\n- Modern memorial services\n- Corporate executive gifts\n- Architectural memorial displays\n- Contemporary home decor\n- Office desk tributes\n- Christmas gifts with modern style\n\n**3D Cube Features:**\n- Perfect geometric proportions\n- 3D laser engraving with depth\n- Multiple viewing angles available\n- Various light base options\n- Can be displayed any orientation\n- Premium crystal clarity\n- Professional presentation\n\n**Military Memorial Significance:**\nThe square/cube shape has special meaning for military memorials:\n- Represents discipline and order\n- Geometric precision reflects military standards\n- All sides equal (like service equality and brotherhood)\n- Strong, stable base (like military foundation)\n- Modern aesthetic appeals to current service members\n\nThis makes the crystal square particularly appropriate for honoring active duty service members, military retirements, and contemporary veteran tributes.\n\n**Display Versatility:**\nUnlike traditional rectangular crystals with obvious \"correct\" orientations, the cube can be displayed multiple ways:\n- Flat orientation for table/desk display\n- Angled position for dynamic presentation\n- Paired with rotating base for changing views\n- Stacked or grouped for multi-veteran displays\n\n**Customization Options:**\n- 3D photo engraving\n- Military insignia and unit patches\n- Rank, name, and service dates\n- 2D or 3D backdrop enhancement\n- Custom memorial text\n- Multiple photos possible on different faces\n\n**Perfect For:**\n- Contemporary military memorials\n- Modern office environments\n- Architectural interior displays\n- Executive retirement gifts\n- Tech industry professionals\n- Younger generation preferences\n- Minimalist memorial aesthetics",
